; corridor_dead_end.tres — Mineshaft dead-end corridor piece.
; 8m long × 3m wide × 4m tall; closed at far end with a small alcove + regular chest.
; Terrain voxels: stone (id=4) floor/ceiling, air (id=0) interior carving.
; Bricks: support beams at entrance, a lantern near alcove. Regular chest at alcove.
; DOCS.md §2 — mineshafts; CONTEXT.md D-07, D-08.
; allowed_biomes = [] — depth-gated by multipass_generator.

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/bricks/brick_template.gd" id="1_btmpl"]

